frame-C7B313B98C0085A83372E8E3F5B51324@mhtml.blink" allowfullscreen=3D"allo=
wfullscreen" class=3D"Ylcf5b"></iframe></div></div></div><h1>Information Go=
ogle collects</h1><h2>We want you to understand the types of information we=
 collect as you use our services</h2><p>We collect information to provide b=
etter services to all our users =E2=80=94 from figuring out basic stuff lik=
e which language you speak, to more complex things like which <a class=3D"Y=
faGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-useful-ads" data=
-name=3D"useful-ads" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-foot=
note-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" rol=
e=3D"button">ads you=E2=80=99ll find most useful</a>, <a class=3D"YfaGG" hr=
ef=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-people-online" data-name=
=3D"people-online" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footno=
te-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=
=3D"button">the people who matter most to you online</a>, or which YouTube =
videos you might like. The information Google collects, and how that inform=
ation is used, depends on how you use our services and how you manage your =
privacy controls.</p><p>Google also collects and uses data that is not asso=
ciated with your account. For example, when you=E2=80=99re not signed in to=
 a Google Account, we store the information we collect with <a class=3D"Yfa=
GG" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-unique-id" data-na=
me=3D"unique-id" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footnote=
-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=3D=
"button">unique identifiers</a> tied to the browser, application, or <a cla=
ss=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-device" d=
ata-name=3D"device" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footn=
ote-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=
=3D"button">device</a> you=E2=80=99re using. This allows us to do things li=
ke maintain your preferences across browsing sessions, such as your preferr=
ed language or whether to show you more relevant search results or ads base=
d on your activity.</p><p>When you=E2=80=99re signed in, we also collect in=
formation that we store with your Google Account, which we treat as <a clas=
s=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-personal-i=
nfo" data-name=3D"personal-info" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=
=3D"opens-footnote-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefaul=
t=3Dtrue)" role=3D"button">personal information</a>.</p><h2>Things you crea=
te or provide to us</h2><div class=3D"w94E5e "><img class=3D"I9WKse" alt=3D=
"" src=3D"https://www.gstatic.com/identity/boq/policies/privacy/pp_2024/02-=
things-you-create-or-provide-to-us-lightmode.svg" data-atf=3D"false" data-i=
ml=3D"1244.2000000001863"></div><p>When you create a Google Account, you pr=
ovide us with <a class=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privac=
y#footnote-personal-info" data-name=3D"personal-info" aria-expanded=3D"fals=
e" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footnote-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:I=
Pbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=3D"button">personal information</a> that=
 includes your name and a password. You can also choose to add a <a class=
=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-phone-numbe=
r" data-name=3D"phone-number" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"o=
pens-footnote-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dt=
rue)" role=3D"button">phone number</a> or <a class=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https:=
//policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-payment-info" data-name=3D"payment-i=
nfo" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footnote-area-descri=
ption" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=3D"button">pay=
ment information</a> to your account. Even if you aren=E2=80=99t signed in =
to a Google Account, you might choose to provide us with information =E2=80=
=94 like an email address to communicate with Google or receive updates abo=
ut our services.</p><p>We also collect the content you create, upload, or r=
eceive from others when using our services.  This includes things like emai=
l you write and receive, photos and videos you save, docs and spreadsheets =
you create, and comments you make on YouTube videos.</p><h2>Information we =
collect as you use our services</h2><h3>Your apps, browsers &amp; devices</=
h3><div class=3D"w94E5e "><img class=3D"I9WKse" alt=3D"" src=3D"https://www=
.gstatic.com/identity/boq/policies/privacy/pp_2024/03-your-apps-browsers-de=
vices-lightmode.svg" data-atf=3D"false" data-iml=3D"1282.7000000001863"></d=
iv><p>We collect information about the apps, browsers, and <a class=3D"YfaG=
G" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-devices" data-name=
=3D"devices" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footnote-are=
a-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=3D"but=
ton">devices</a> you use to access Google services, which helps us provide =
features like automatic product updates and dimming your screen if your bat=
tery runs low.</p><p>The information we collect includes <a class=3D"YfaGG"=
 href=3D"https://policies.google.com/privacy#footnote-unique-id" data-name=
=3D"unique-id" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footnote-a=
rea-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=3D"b=
utton">unique identifiers</a>, browser type and settings, device type and s=
ettings, operating system, mobile network information including carrier nam=
e and phone number, and application version number. We also collect informa=
tion about the interaction of your apps, browsers, and devices with our ser=
vices, including <a class=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.com/pri=
vacy#footnote-ip" data-name=3D"ip" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-describedby=
=3D"opens-footnote-area-description" jsaction=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefaul=
t=3Dtrue)" role=3D"button">IP address</a>, crash reports, system activity, =
and the date, time, and <a class=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.=
com/privacy#footnote-referrer-url" data-name=3D"referrer-url" aria-expanded=
=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footnote-area-description" jsaction=3D=
"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=3D"button">referrer URL</a> of y=
our request.</p><p>We collect this information when a Google service on you=
r device contacts our servers =E2=80=94 for example, when you install an ap=
p from the Play Store or when a service checks for automatic updates. If yo=
u=E2=80=99re using an <a class=3D"YfaGG" href=3D"https://policies.google.co=
m/privacy#footnote-android-device" data-name=3D"android-device" aria-expand=
ed=3D"false" aria-describedby=3D"opens-footnote-area-description" jsaction=
=3D"click:IPbaae(preventDefault=3Dtrue)" role=3D"button">Android device wit=
h Google apps</a>, your device periodically contacts Google servers to prov=
ide information about your device and connection to our services. This info=
rmation includes things like your <a href=3D"https://support.google.com/and=
roid/answer/9021432" class=3D"N6CPUe" target=3D"_blank" aria-describedby=3D=
